{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23400","headline":"秋池二首 二 · 白居易","name":"秋池二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝衣薄且健，晚簟清仍滑。\n社近燕影稀，雨余蝉声歇。\n闲中得诗境，此境幽难说。\n露荷珠自倾，风竹玉相戛。\n谁能一同宿，共翫新秋月。\n暑退早凉归，池边好时节。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}